    "blurb": "Decompose and orchestrate mixed product orders",
    "overview": "This blueprint addresses challenges around retail mobile device orders to ensure a positive customer experience and reduce the chance of fraud.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Orchestrate Hardware and Mobile Orders in Parallel",
    "splashDescription": "Retail mobile device orders are high frequency and high impact for customer experience, and involve a significant risk of fraud. Delays or inaccuracies can occur with inaccurate inventory, phone number activation, payment processing, and delivery tracking. This blueprint provides the foundation for addressing each step and decomposes orders for parallel execution of both hardware and mobile fulfillment.",
